>> title: Blini
>> category: Flatbreads & Pancakes
>> tags: buckwheat, russian, yeast, skillet
>> servings: 8
>> time: 2 hr
>> step.6: cook in 3-in rounds, 1 min per side

Whisk @warm whole milk{1 1/2%cup}(360 mL), @instant yeast{1 1/2%tsp}(5 g), and @sugar{1%tsp}(4 g).

Beat @&(~1)yeast milk{} with @buckwheat flour{1%cup}(120 g), @all-purpose flour{1/2%cup}(65 g).

Rise @&(~1)sponge{} covered in a warm place ~{1%hr}, until bubbly.

Stir @&(~1)sponge{} with @egg{1%large}(50 g), @melted unsalted butter{2%Tbsp}(28 g), @fine sea salt{3/4%tsp}(4 g).

Rest @&(~1)batter{} ~{20%min}.

Spoon @&(~1)batter{} into a #skillet{} filmed with @butter for the pan{2%Tbsp}(28 g) and cook ~{1%min} per side.
